ars, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids, June to July came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 46% of normal in August to September and 144% in June to July. Grid 25352 had its driest year in 1988 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
